# --- Game-derived material is local-only, except the organized per-class export ---
# Extracted/generated game material lives in data/, gen/ and docs/generated/ (all local-only).
# The one exception is data/identified_organized/ (decompiled functions, one .c per class), which is tracked.
data/*
!data/identified_organized/
gen/
docs/generated/
# Ghidra project (local database)
Commons/
*.gpr
*.rep/
*.lock
*.lock~
# Build output
build/
out/
.vs/
.run/
__pycache__/
# Binaries
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.obj
*.lib
*.bin
*.flm
*.whl
# Logs / scratch
scratch_*
*.err.txt
*.out.txt
events.jsonl
tools/run_coverage.*.txt
